+ *     DRAM ring all-zero       -> FL1100 never landed the write -> REACHABILITY
+ *     cached != DRAM TRB        -> FL1100 wrote, guest reads stale -> COHERENCE
+ *     garbage TRB types         -> wrong translation / wrong memory
